    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>House of Guilt</strong> is a first-person horror game set in the 1940s.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as <strong>Robert Smith</strong>, a wealthy middle aged man at his office who is being tormented by something terrifying.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>House of Guilt</strong> is mostly a horror walking sim, with simple puzzles elements, find out what is happening and the reason why.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your fate and uncover the <strong>3 alternative endings</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game should take you <strong>between 2 to 3 hours\u00a0</strong>to fully complete.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Attention!!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game contains flashes of light that can cause epileptic seizures.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>House of Guilt</strong> is a first-person horror game set in the 1940s.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as <strong>Robert Smith</strong>, a wealthy middle aged man at his office who is being tormented by something terrifying.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>House of Guilt</strong> is mostly a horror walking sim, with simple puzzles elements, find out what is happening and the reason why.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your fate and uncover the <strong>3 alternative endings</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game should take you <strong>between 2 to 3 hours\u00a0</strong>to fully complete.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Attention!!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game contains flashes of light that can cause epileptic seizures.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2>",
